                    "id": "timeline-html",
                    "elType": "widget",
                    "widgetType": "html",
                    "settings": {
                        "html": "<div class=\"timeline-container\">\n  <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year\" style=\"font-size: 28px;\">Why</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n      <h4 class=\"timeline-title\" style=\"text-transform: none;\">Most of what we carry started young.</h4>\n      <p class=\"timeline-desc\">In working with adults, a pattern became clear. Most of the pain people are processing in their 30s and 40s has roots in childhood \u2014 in things they were never given language for.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year\" style=\"font-size: 28px;\">Decks</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n      <h4 class=\"timeline-title\" style=\"text-transform: none;\">Affirmation Decks</h4>\n      <p class=\"timeline-desc\">Simple, visual affirmations designed for children aged 4\u201312. Beautiful, gentle, and genuinely fun to use \u2014 alone or with a parent.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year\" style=\"font-size: 28px;\">Talks</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n      <h4 class=\"timeline-title\" style=\"text-transform: none;\">Conversation Decks</h4>\n      <p class=\"timeline-desc\">Cards that open real conversations between kids and the adults who love them. About feelings, fears, and what it means to be okay.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year\" style=\"font-size: 28px;\">Reason</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-content timeline-last\">\n      <h4 class=\"timeline-title\" style=\"text-transform: none;\">Why we built them</h4>\n      <p class=\"timeline-desc\">Not as a product line. As a response to what we kept seeing in our adult sessions. Every card is built with intention \u2014 and with the child's inner world in mind.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.timeline-container {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 3rem;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.timeline-item {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: row;\n  gap: 3rem;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n}\n\n.timeline-year {\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 128px;\n  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n  font-size: 36px;\n  color: #688F9D;\n}\n\n.timeline-content {\n  flex-grow: 1;\n  padding-bottom: 3rem;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(29, 49, 82, 0.1);\n}\n\n.timeline-last {\n  border-bottom: none;\n  padding-bottom: 0;\n}\n\n.timeline-title {\n  font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  color: #1D3152;\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n}\n\n.timeline-desc {\n  font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: rgba(29, 49, 82, 0.6);\n  max-width: 42rem;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .timeline-item {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .timeline-year {\n    width: auto;\n  }\n  .timeline-content {\n    padding-bottom: 2rem;\n  }\n}\n</style>"
                    }
